IMU algorithm provenance / IMU 算法来源
---------------------------------------

The calibration, Mahony and tilt modules are an independent C99
re-implementation of the algorithms reached from app_main() in a local
reference project (MagicRobot_V0.1/embedded). They were written from the
actual executed code, not the comments; the accel-bias/Mahony inconsistency
of that reference is documented in docs/imu-calibration.md and deliberately
not reproduced.

校准、Mahony 与倾角模块是对某个本地参考工程（MagicRobot_V0.1/embedded）
中 app_main() 实际可达代码路径的独立 C99 重新实现：以实际执行代码为准、
不采信其注释；该参考中 accel 偏置/Mahony 的缺陷在 docs/imu-calibration.md
有记录，本项目有意未复现。

